@MovieDate_HostAddress = http://localhost:5069

GET {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Auth — register (password: min 8 chars, no class requirements)
POST {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "password1"
}

### Auth — login with cookie (expect Set-Cookie: HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict)
POST {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login?useCookies=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "password1"
}

### Auth — current user (200 with cookie, 401 without)
GET {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Auth — logout (204; 401 when not signed in)
POST {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

###

### Movies — search the catalog (signed in; q < 2 chars → []; 401 without cookie)
GET {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/movies?q=ojciec
Accept: application/json

### Movies — search by original title
GET {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/movies?q=godfather
Accept: application/json

### Watched — my list (most recently updated first)
GET {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/watched
Accept: application/json

### Watched — add (201; 400 rating outside 1–10; 404 unknown movie; 409 already on the list)
# Take movieId from a search result above.
@movieId = 1
POST {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/watched
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": {{movieId}},
  "rating": 9
}

### Watched — update rating (200; 400; 404 when not on my list)
PUT {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/watched/{{movieId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 10
}

### Watched — remove (204; 404 when not on my list)
DELETE {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/watched/{{movieId}}

###

### Watchlist — my want-to-watch list (most recently added first)
GET {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/watchlist
Accept: application/json

### Watchlist — add (201; 404 unknown movie; 409 already on the watchlist)
POST {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": {{movieId}}
}

### Watchlist — mark watched: moves the entry to /api/watched with a rating
### (200; 404 not on my watchlist; 400 rating outside 1–10; 409 already rated — entry stays on the watchlist)
POST {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/watchlist/{{movieId}}/watched
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 8
}

### Watchlist — remove (204; 404 when not on my watchlist)
DELETE {{MovieDate_HostAddress}}/api/watchlist/{{movieId}}

###
